On Mon, 2010-06-14 at 10:25 +0100, Russell King - ARM Linux wrote:
> On Sun, Jun 13, 2010 at 09:45:50PM -1000, Mitch Bradley wrote:
> > None of this is a deal-breaker for the kind of debugging tasks that are  
